## Rule Categories by Priority

| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |
|----------|----------|--------|--------|
| 1 | CLI Provisioning | CRITICAL | `create-db-cli` |
| 2 | Management API | CRITICAL | `management-api` |
| 3 | Management API SDK | HIGH | `management-api-sdk` |
